\n\n** Upcoming: Experience und Levelsystem\n** Soon: Use the ingame voicechat for communication.\n", "short_description": "Play this VR game with friends and others.\nProtect your stack and destroy the blocks of your opponents.\nWin the game by having the biggest stack at the end of the round.\nSearch for games or host your own.\nFull Crossplay support! Play on Quest 1 or 2 versus PCVR Players.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Area 1 GmbH", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://stackdefense.area1.one/stackdefense/privacy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Area 1 GmbH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.area1.one/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "ARCADE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "619005295850681"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4791367364210775"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "4791367364210775"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1627417980, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4791367364210775"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4152766918107111", "version": "0.9.5"}, "id": "1221299208327914", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries":